title: TaggedDocsConfig
---

> **Since** (1.0.0)

A config with tags in its doc comments.

## Index

| Property | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| [`added`](#added) | `string` | Added after the config. |
| [`example`](#example) | `string` | A line of an example that starts with `@` is kept. |
| [`level`](#level) | [`TaggedDocsEnum`](./TaggedDocsEnum.md) |  |
| [`old`](#old) | `string` | Deprecated through its doc comment. |
| [`older`](#older) | `string` | Deprecated by both, where the attribute wins. |

